Six flows are forbidden, and each is attacked in a test.

11
00:00:28,628 --> 00:00:33,087
The role matrix alone made 560 attempts with 419/419 denied

12
00:00:33,087 --> 00:00:35,053
(RE-MEASURED 11 Nov 2026).

13
00:00:35,953 --> 00:00:37,666
