00:00:44,657 --> 00:00:48,496
UID, never the broker's UID 1000, so a mounted key gives

17
00:00:48,496 --> 00:00:50,895
errno 13 (RE-MEASURED 11 Nov 2026).

18
00:00:51,795 --> 00:00:55,747
The real model, Qwen2.5-0.5B on llama.cpp, runs in a

19
00:00:55,747 --> 00:00:58,406
