The run sealed and was released.

27
00:01:19,628 --> 00:01:24,089
With the real model the default policy is deadline release:

28
00:01:24,089 --> 00:01:27,264
every reply leaves at t0 + 1400 ms (LIVE).

29
00:01:28,164 --> 00:01:30,472
The audit page lists 6 detectors (LIVE).

30
00:01:30,472 --> 00:01:33,877
The scripted red agent's probes fired two of them, and both

31
00:01:33,877 --> 00:01:36,012
