32
00:01:36,912 --> 00:01:40,531
On the evidence page, the independent verifier accepts the

33
00:01:40,531 --> 00:01:40,968
bundle.

34
00:01:40,968 --> 00:01:44,150
A tampered copy is rejected, and the original stays

35
00:01:44,150 --> 00:01:45,085
