36
00:01:45,985 --> 00:01:49,933
The user-namespace proof samples every running container:

37
00:01:49,933 --> 00:01:54,020
13/13 F4 checks (LIVE), each container on its own host UID.

38
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:58,578
Leakage with the real model, re-measured on the finale code:

