60
00:03:16,104 --> 00:03:19,272
One edited field in a copy gives exit code 1 (LIVE).

61
00:03:20,172 --> 00:03:23,497
The countersignature refuses a forgery made with the broker

62
00:03:23,497 --> 00:03:23,722
